    "uz": "Uchta motorni bir-biridan mustaqil boshqaring. QF1–QF3 kirishlari umumiy L1–L3 ga. Har bir motor uchun: QFx → KMx → KKx → Mx; boshqaruv: QFx.T1(2) → KKx (NC 95–96) → Stop → Start (+ KMx NO 13–14) → KMx.A1. A2 klemmalari umumiy N ga.",
    "ru": "Управляйте тремя двигателями независимо. Входы QF1–QF3 — на общие L1–L3. Для каждого: QFx → KMx → KKx → Mx; управление: QFx.T1(2) → KKx (NC 95–96) → Стоп → Пуск (+ KMx NO 13–14) → KMx.A1. A2 — на общий N.",
    "en": "Control three motors independently. QF1–QF3 inputs go to the common L1–L3. For each: QFx → KMx → KKx → Mx; control: QFx.T1(2) → KKx (NC 95–96) → Stop → Start (+ KMx NO 13–14) → KMx.A1. A2 terminals to the common N."
  },
